  ('meta', 'salaire médian : « the median of the annual total compensation of all employees of our company (other than our CEO) was $388,200 » ; rémunération totale du PDG : « the annual total compensation of our CEO was $25,125,904 » ; périmètre : « we included all worldwide full-time and part-time employees other than our CEO » ; le calcul compte aussi les actions attribuées aux salariés : « the value of equity awards granted to our employees in 2025 »'),
  ('microsoft', 'salaire médian puis rémunération totale du PDG : « the annual total compensation for the median employee of the Company (other than our CEO) was $200,972 and the annual total compensation of our CEO was $96,496,790 » ; périmètre : « we then calculated the total direct compensation for our global employee population »'),
  ('netflix', 'salaire médian : « The 2025 annual total compensation as determined under Item 402 of Regulation S-K for our median employee was $211,201 » ; rémunération totale de l’un des deux co-PDG : « the 2025 annual total compensation as determined under Item 402 of Regulation S-K was $53,905,972 » ; qui est le salarié médian : « who is a full-time employee based in the United States »'),
  ('amazon', 'salaire médian, salariés du monde entier : « The 2025 annual total compensation of our median compensated employee (identified from all full- and part-time permanent and temporary employees worldwide, excluding our CEO) was $40,206 » ; rémunération totale du PDG : « 2025 annual total compensation as reported under SEC rules was $2,069,861 » ; salaire médian des salariés américains à temps plein : « the median annual total compensation for all U.S. full-time Amazon employees was $53,211 »'),
  ('nike', 'qui est le salarié médian : « The employee identified at the median of all NIKE employees (other than our CEO) was a retail employee in the United Kingdom » ; salaire médian : « The annual total compensation of the median employee was $48,695 » ; répartition des salariés : « approximately 73% were full-time, 53% were in retail jobs, and 49% were located in the United States »'),
  ('pepsico', 'salaire médian : « The median employee’s total compensation was $53,296 » ; rémunération totale du PDG : « our CEO’s compensation was $23,903,545 » ; salariés hors des États-Unis : « More than half of our employees are located outside the United States in locations where the cost of living is significantly below the U.S., including developing and emerging markets »'),
  ('procter-gamble', 'salaire médian puis rémunération totale des PDG au prorata : « the median of the annual total compensation of all employees of the Company (other than our CEO) was $68,595, and the annual total compensation of the CEOs, prorated for time worked, was $19,025,326 » ; périmètre : « our employee population consisted of approximately 106,890 active employees »'),
  ('mondelez', 'salaire médian : « (“Median Employee”) was $38,024 » ; salariés hors des États-Unis : « with over eight in 10 employees located outside the U.S. » ; temps partiel : « a significant portion of our work force consists of part-time and seasonal employees » ; sans correction du coût de la vie : « without applying any cost-of-living adjustments »'),
  ('colgate-palmolive', 'salaire médian puis rémunération totale du PDG : « was $59,655 and the annual total compensation of the CEO, as reported in the Summary Compensation Table on page 46, was $16,478,196 » ; salariés hors des États-Unis : « with over 80% of our employees based outside the United States in over 100 countries »'),
