  ('mcdonalds', 'salariés hors des États-Unis : « approximately 70% are based outside of the U.S. » ; temps partiel : « Most of these employees work in flexible, part-time roles »'),
  ('starbucks', 'qui est le salarié médian : « The fiscal year 2025 annual total compensation for our median employee, a part -time barista in the U.S., was $17,279 » ; rémunération totale du PDG : « was $30,992,773, as reported in the Summary Compensation Table of this proxy statement » ; périmètre : « the median compensation disclosed below is based on our global workforce and is not designed to capture the median compensation of our U.S. partners »'),
  ('yum-brands', 'qui est le salarié médian : « our median employee was identified as a part-time Taco Bell restaurant employee in the United States » ; salaire médian : « The total compensation of our median employee was estimated to be $15,346 » ; temps partiel : « In the United States, approximately 90% of our Company-owned restaurant employees are part-time »'),
